cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "Heparin decay nomogram pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A simulation-calibrated informatics pipeline that fits a single-compartment
  exponential approximation to published pharmacokinetic models of
  unfractionated heparin, and renders the result as an institution-specific
  decay nomogram. A research and educational instrument; not for clinical use.
version: 2.0.0
